# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is the paper's reproducible artifact: the code that produces
# and verifies every reported number, the artifacts themselves, the manuscript
# sources, and the instructions to rebuild the data. Everything below is kept
# in the authors' working copy but deliberately stays out of the public repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Datasets are not redistributed -----------------------------------------
# The CWRU 12 kHz drive-end and Paderborn KAt recordings are third-party public
# datasets and remain under their original terms. Together they are ~15 GB.
# Rebuild them locally instead: python tools/prepare_cwru.py, and see README §2
# for the Paderborn layout.
data/
# Cached copies of the official downloads and the windowed .npz caches (keyed
# on a content fingerprint of the source files, so they invalidate on change).
.cache/

# --- Internal working documents ---------------------------------------------
# Working notes, submission correspondence and the audit trail of the CWRU
# 99.mat defect. None of it is written for readers of the paper; the material a
# reviewer needs is in README.md and in the manuscript.
README_内部.md
接手文档.md
paper/cover_letter_*.md
results_paper/pre_fix_x098/

# --- Exploratory runs --------------------------------------------------------
# Only results/final/*.csv backs a table in the paper. The rest are intermediate
# sweeps and smoke tests (kscan, seedscan, main*, probe*, smoke*) kept locally
# for the record.
results/*/
!results/final/
results/tables_source_POOLED_across_all_dirs.csv
# Parts a and bc of probe_paderborn.py: superseded by results_pb/pb_levels.json,
# which is what Tables 5 and 6 are checked against.
results_pb/README.md
results_pb/a_consistency.json
results_pb/b_leakage.json
results_pb/confirm_src.log

# --- Local diagnostic and exploration scripts --------------------------------
# Kept in the working copy; not part of the published artifact.
tools/diag_*.py
tools/calibrate_*.py
tools/compare_*.py
tools/probe_envelope.py
tools/probe_multiclass.py
tools/probe_norm.py
tools/probe_simreal.py
tools/probe_twin_calib.py
tools/crossref_lookup.py
tools/make_supplementary.py

# The package submitted to the journal is assembled by copying files out of
# this repository, so its output would duplicate the whole tree.
supplementary/
supplementary.zip

# Windows-only environment repairs for the authors' machine
diag.bat
fix_torch.bat

# --- LaTeX intermediates -----------------------------------------------------
# Sources, bibliography, figures and the submitted PDF are tracked on purpose;
# everything a compile regenerates is not.
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.spl
paper/manuscript.pdf
texput.log
*.synctex.gz

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
